  dct:description """The 4th phase of the Copernicus Emergency Management Service (CEMS) includes a framework contract with reopening of competition for flexible products (so called FLEX).
The service consists of the on-demand provision of geospatial information. This information supports emergency management activities not related to the immediate response phase.This service addresses prevention, preparedness, disaster risk reduction and/or recovery phases. Economic operators are invited to participate in the request for information at the following link: https://ec.europa.eu/eusurvey/runner/CEMS_Flex_2023. """@en;
  dct:title "FRAMEWORK SERVICE CONTRACT FOR COPERNICUS EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT SERVICE (CEMS) RISK AND RECOVERY MAPPING (RRM) TAILOR-MADE PRODUCTS (FLEX)"@en;
